    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 67,
    "dress": "old-alien",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-alien_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 14,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あっ、たしかに……。わたし、部長と似たような会話をしたかも。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「君咲城でしたような、会話を。むかぁし、君咲学院の文芸部部室で」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたし、入部したてで……。部長も、『生徒会長再任選挙』のせいで振り回されてて。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「たまに、わたしに甘えに部室にきたんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あぁ文芸部の部室が、大奥だったんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-princess2",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-princess2_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたし、ちっとも文芸部の活動をしてくれない部長に腹を立てていて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「でも部長はいつもわたしがどんな酷いことを言っても、ゆるしてくれたんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「抱きしめて、愛してるよって言ってくれたんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「自分がいちばん、つらかったくせに。わたし、部長にもっと優しくしてあげたらよかった」"
  },
